<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<wsdl:definitions name="eBayAPI"
    xmlns:wsdl="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/"
    xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/wsdl/soap/"
    xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
    xmlns:ns="urn:ebay:apis:eBLBaseComponents"
    targetNamespace="urn:ebay:apis:eBLBaseComponents">
  <wsdl:documentation>
    A subset of the eBay Trading API (SOAP), written from its public documentation:
    fixed-price listings made with AddFixedPriceItem, read with GetItem, changed with
    ReviseFixedPriceItem, ended with EndFixedPriceItem and listed with GetMyeBaySelling.
    Every request carries the seller's token in the RequesterCredentials SOAP header.

    Every response carries Timestamp, Ack and the Version and Build that answered. A
    call that fails answers Ack Failure with one or more Errors (ShortMessage,
    LongMessage, ErrorCode, SeverityCode Error) in the normal response element, not a
    SOAP Fault; a Fault is only for a request that is not a valid SOAP message. Ack
    Warning means the call succeeded with Errors of SeverityCode Warning.

    Money is an AmountType: a decimal value with the currency in the currencyID
    attribute, as in &lt;StartPrice currencyID="USD"&gt;19.99&lt;/StartPrice&gt;. Fees are
    answered in the currency of the site the item is listed on (USD on the US site).

    AddFixedPriceItem answers the new listing's ItemID (a string of digits, unique on
    eBay), its StartTime and EndTime, and the Fees for listing it, one Fee per fee
    name, ListingFee among them. A new listing is Active (SellingStatus.ListingStatus).
    With InventoryTrackingMethod SKU, the seller's SKU identifies the listing: GetItem,
    ReviseFixedPriceItem and EndFixedPriceItem accept the SKU in place of the ItemID,
    and a second AddFixedPriceItem with a SKU that an active listing of the seller
    already has is refused with Ack Failure.

    ReviseFixedPriceItem changes only the Item fields it is sent and keeps the others;
    the ItemID does not change. EndFixedPriceItem ends the listing at once and answers
    its EndTime; afterwards GetItem still answers the item, with ListingStatus Completed
    (or Ended), and the listing is no longer in the seller's ActiveList.

    GetMyeBaySelling answers the seller's ActiveList when it is asked for with Include
    true, paged by Pagination (EntriesPerPage, PageNumber from 1); PaginationResult
    holds TotalNumberOfEntries (the active listings in all pages) and TotalNumberOfPages.
  </wsdl:documentation>
  <wsdl:types>
    <xs:schema targetNamespace="urn:ebay:apis:eBLBaseComponents" elementFormDefault="qualified">
      <xs:simpleType name="AckCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="Success"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Failure"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Warning"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="PartialFailure"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="SeverityCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="Error"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Warning"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="ErrorClassificationCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="RequestError"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="SystemError"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="CurrencyCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="USD"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="CAD"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="GBP"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="EUR"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="AUD"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="CountryCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="US"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="CA"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="GB"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="DE"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="AU"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="ListingTypeCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="FixedPriceItem"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Chinese"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="ListingStatusCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="Active"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Ended"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="Completed"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="InventoryTrackingMethodCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="ItemID"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="SKU"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>
      <xs:simpleType name="EndReasonCodeType">
        <xs:restriction base="xs:token">
          <xs:enumeration value="Incorrect"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="LostOrBroken"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="NotAvailable"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="OtherListingError"/>
          <xs:enumeration value="SellToHighBidder"/>
        </xs:restriction>
      </xs:simpleType>

      <xs:complexType name="AmountType">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>A decimal amount; currencyID names its currency.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
        <xs:simpleContent>
          <xs:extension base="xs:double">
            <xs:attribute name="currencyID" type="ns:CurrencyCodeType" use="required"/>
          </xs:extension>
        </xs:simpleContent>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="ErrorType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="ShortMessage" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="LongMessage" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ErrorCode" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="SeverityCode" type="ns:SeverityCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ErrorClassification" type="ns:ErrorClassificationCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="CustomSecurityHeaderType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="eBayAuthToken" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:element name="RequesterCredentials" type="ns:CustomSecurityHeaderType"/>

      <xs:complexType name="AbstractRequestType" abstract="true">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="ErrorLanguage" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Version" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="WarningLevel" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="AbstractResponseType" abstract="true">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Timestamp" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Ack" type="ns:AckCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Errors" type="ns:ErrorType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
          <xs:element name="Version" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Build" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>

      <xs:complexType name="CategoryType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="CategoryID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="CategoryName" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="ListingDetailsType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="StartTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="EndTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ViewItemURL" type="xs:anyURI" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="SellingStatusType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="CurrentPrice" type="ns:AmountType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="QuantitySold" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ListingStatus" type="ns:ListingStatusCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="ItemType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Country" type="ns:CountryCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Currency" type="ns:CurrencyCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Description" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="DispatchTimeMax" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ItemID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ListingDetails" type="ns:ListingDetailsType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ListingDuration" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ListingType" type="ns:ListingTypeCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Location" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="PrimaryCategory" type="ns:CategoryType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Quantity" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="SellingStatus" type="ns:SellingStatusType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="StartPrice" type="ns:AmountType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Title" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="PostalCode" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="ConditionID" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="InventoryTrackingMethod" type="ns:InventoryTrackingMethodCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="FeeType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Name" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Fee" type="ns:AmountType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="FeesType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Fee" type="ns:FeeType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="ItemArrayType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Item" type="ns:ItemType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="PaginationType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="EntriesPerPage" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="PageNumber" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="PaginationResultType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="TotalNumberOfPages" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="TotalNumberOfEntries" type="xs:int" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="ItemListCustomizationType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="Include" type="xs:boolean" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Sort" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="Pagination" type="ns:PaginationType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>
      <xs:complexType name="PaginatedItemArrayType">
        <xs:sequence>
          <xs:element name="ItemArray" type="ns:ItemArrayType" minOccurs="0"/>
          <xs:element name="PaginationResult" type="ns:PaginationResultType" minOccurs="0"/>
        </xs:sequence>
      </xs:complexType>

      <xs:element name="AddFixedPriceItemRequest">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractRequestType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="Item" type="ns:ItemType"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="AddFixedPriceItemResponse">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractResponseType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ItemID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="StartTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="EndTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="Fees" type="ns:FeesType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="CategoryID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="GetItemRequest">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractRequestType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ItemID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="DetailLevel" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="GetItemResponse">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractResponseType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="Item" type="ns:ItemType" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="ReviseFixedPriceItemRequest">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractRequestType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="Item" type="ns:ItemType"/>
                <xs:element name="DeletedField" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="ReviseFixedPriceItemResponse">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractResponseType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ItemID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="StartTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="EndTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="Fees" type="ns:FeesType" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="EndFixedPriceItemRequest">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractRequestType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ItemID" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="EndingReason" type="ns:EndReasonCodeType" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="EndFixedPriceItemResponse">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractResponseType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="EndTime" type="xs:dateTime" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SKU" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="GetMyeBaySellingRequest">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractRequestType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ActiveList" type="ns:ItemListCustomizationType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SoldList" type="ns:ItemListCustomizationType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="UnsoldList" type="ns:ItemListCustomizationType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="DetailLevel" type="xs:token" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
      <xs:element name="GetMyeBaySellingResponse">
        <xs:complexType>
          <xs:complexContent>
            <xs:extension base="ns:AbstractResponseType">
              <xs:sequence>
                <xs:element name="ActiveList" type="ns:PaginatedItemArrayType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="SoldList" type="ns:PaginatedItemArrayType" minOccurs="0"/>
                <xs:element name="UnsoldList" type="ns:PaginatedItemArrayType" minOccurs="0"/>
              </xs:sequence>
            </xs:extension>
          </xs:complexContent>
        </xs:complexType>
      </xs:element>
    </xs:schema>
  </wsdl:types>

  <wsdl:message name="RequesterCredentials"><wsdl:part name="RequesterCredentials" element="ns:RequesterCredentials"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="AddFixedPriceItemRequest"><wsdl:part name="AddFixedPriceItemRequest" element="ns:AddFixedPriceItemRequest"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="AddFixedPriceItemResponse"><wsdl:part name="AddFixedPriceItemResponse" element="ns:AddFixedPriceItemResponse"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="GetItemRequest"><wsdl:part name="GetItemRequest" element="ns:GetItemRequest"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="GetItemResponse"><wsdl:part name="GetItemResponse" element="ns:GetItemResponse"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="ReviseFixedPriceItemRequest"><wsdl:part name="ReviseFixedPriceItemRequest" element="ns:ReviseFixedPriceItemRequest"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="ReviseFixedPriceItemResponse"><wsdl:part name="ReviseFixedPriceItemResponse" element="ns:ReviseFixedPriceItemResponse"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="EndFixedPriceItemRequest"><wsdl:part name="EndFixedPriceItemRequest" element="ns:EndFixedPriceItemRequest"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="EndFixedPriceItemResponse"><wsdl:part name="EndFixedPriceItemResponse" element="ns:EndFixedPriceItemResponse"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="GetMyeBaySellingRequest"><wsdl:part name="GetMyeBaySellingRequest" element="ns:GetMyeBaySellingRequest"/></wsdl:message>
  <wsdl:message name="GetMyeBaySellingResponse"><wsdl:part name="GetMyeBaySellingResponse" element="ns:GetMyeBaySellingResponse"/></wsdl:message>

  <wsdl:portType name="eBayAPIInterface">
    <wsdl:operation name="AddFixedPriceItem">
      <wsdl:documentation>Lists a fixed-price item. Answers its ItemID, StartTime, EndTime and the Fees for listing it; the new listing is Active. A SKU an active listing of the seller already has is refused with Ack Failure when InventoryTrackingMethod is SKU.</wsdl:documentation>
      <wsdl:input message="ns:AddFixedPriceItemRequest"/>
      <wsdl:output message="ns:AddFixedPriceItemResponse"/>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="GetItem">
      <wsdl:documentation>Answers one listing by ItemID, or by SKU for a listing tracked by SKU, with its current SellingStatus. An ended listing is still answered.</wsdl:documentation>
      <wsdl:input message="ns:GetItemRequest"/>
      <wsdl:output message="ns:GetItemResponse"/>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="ReviseFixedPriceItem">
      <wsdl:documentation>Changes the Item fields sent (Item.ItemID or Item.SKU names the listing) and keeps the others. The ItemID stays the same.</wsdl:documentation>
      <wsdl:input message="ns:ReviseFixedPriceItemRequest"/>
      <wsdl:output message="ns:ReviseFixedPriceItemResponse"/>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="EndFixedPriceItem">
      <wsdl:documentation>Ends a listing at once and answers its EndTime. The listing then reads as Completed (or Ended) and leaves the seller's ActiveList.</wsdl:documentation>
      <wsdl:input message="ns:EndFixedPriceItemRequest"/>
      <wsdl:output message="ns:EndFixedPriceItemResponse"/>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="GetMyeBaySelling">
      <wsdl:documentation>Answers the seller's active listings (ActiveList with Include true), paged by Pagination; PaginationResult.TotalNumberOfEntries counts them across all pages.</wsdl:documentation>
      <wsdl:input message="ns:GetMyeBaySellingRequest"/>
      <wsdl:output message="ns:GetMyeBaySellingResponse"/>
    </wsdl:operation>
  </wsdl:portType>

  <wsdl:binding name="eBayAPISoapBinding" type="ns:eBayAPIInterface">
    <soap:binding style="document" transport="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http"/>
    <wsdl:operation name="AddFixedPriceItem">
      <soap:operation soapAction=""/>
      <wsdl:input><soap:header message="ns:RequesterCredentials" part="RequesterCredentials" use="literal"/><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:input>
      <wsdl:output><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:output>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="GetItem">
      <soap:operation soapAction=""/>
      <wsdl:input><soap:header message="ns:RequesterCredentials" part="RequesterCredentials" use="literal"/><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:input>
      <wsdl:output><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:output>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="ReviseFixedPriceItem">
      <soap:operation soapAction=""/>
      <wsdl:input><soap:header message="ns:RequesterCredentials" part="RequesterCredentials" use="literal"/><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:input>
      <wsdl:output><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:output>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="EndFixedPriceItem">
      <soap:operation soapAction=""/>
      <wsdl:input><soap:header message="ns:RequesterCredentials" part="RequesterCredentials" use="literal"/><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:input>
      <wsdl:output><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:output>
    </wsdl:operation>
    <wsdl:operation name="GetMyeBaySelling">
      <soap:operation soapAction=""/>
      <wsdl:input><soap:header message="ns:RequesterCredentials" part="RequesterCredentials" use="literal"/><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:input>
      <wsdl:output><soap:body use="literal"/></wsdl:output>
    </wsdl:operation>
  </wsdl:binding>

  <wsdl:service name="eBayAPIInterfaceService">
    <wsdl:port name="eBayAPI" binding="ns:eBayAPISoapBinding">
      <soap:address location="https://api.ebay.com/wsapi"/>
    </wsdl:port>
  </wsdl:service>
</wsdl:definitions>
